    "text": "learn a lot about why"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:54.480",
    "end": "00:05:58.150",
    "text": "um I say things that I say."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:58.160",
    "end": "00:05:59.510",
    "text": "And I've got a number of people that are"
