    "text": "short amount of time to live."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.080",
    "end": "00:06:22.830",
    "text": "So, you know,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:22.840",
    "end": "00:06:24.950",
    "text": "the proof is in the pudding. Where these"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:24.960",
